          <StackPanel Spacing="6"><TextBlock Name="LauncherSettingsFeedback" Text="{loc:Translate LauncherFeedback}" Classes="status"/><Button Content="{loc:Loc t2cd0f3be8738a86c}" Command="{Binding CancelSettingsWorkCommand}" IsVisible="{Binding IsLauncherBusy}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/></StackPanel>
        </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
    </DockPanel>
  </Grid>
</UserControl>
